            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to him, “Call his name Jezreel; for yet a little while, and I will punish the house of Jehu for the blood of Jezreel, and I will put an end to the kingdom of the house of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
